sequenceDiagram
    participant DRM as lx.drm / KMS
    participant Comp as compositor UI
    participant Pres as presentation_tracker
    participant RT as render thread
    participant Out as output_manager

    Comp->>Out: present_mode_for(output)
    RT->>RT: acquire snapshot + record
    RT->>DRM: atomic commit + page_flip
    DRM-->>Comp: page_flip event (P1)
    DRM-->>Pres: presentation_feedback + kms_damage (P1)
    Pres->>Comp: on_feedback — adjust pacing

    Note over Comp,Pres: P0: timer vsync stub until DRM wired
